│ sequence                                                                     │
│     defined by:                                                              │
│         S(0) = 1                                                             │
│         S(1) = 1                                                             │
│         S(n) = 2 * S(n-1) + S(n-2) for n >= 2                                │
│                                                                              │
│     The function finds the nth prime number in this sequence.                │
│                                                                              │
